        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "批 counts batches or groups treated as a unit for an event, such as incoming students or goods.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "这批学生来自北京。",
                "pinyin": "zhè pī xuéshēng láizì Běijīng 。",
                "meaning": "This batch of students comes from Beijing.",
                "audio": "412cc2bb6fc48342b279ebdb25937146191d4a53347325c42f3e110468b0336d"
              },
              {
                "text": "新的一批货到了。",
                "pinyin": "xīn de yī pī huò dào le 。",
                "meaning": "A new batch of goods has arrived.",
